                                                "sense_id": "075c0c8e-543e-317a-82fe-7c054f4c7c7a",
                                                "text": "“The best way to clean the machine is to put a pound of borax and a gallon of vinegar in the machine and run the longest, hottest cycle you have,” he says."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3905a625-715b-31d9-8db7-111db4e08bd9",
